<title>POLAND: Chemiskor Q1 net rises to PLN 1.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Chemiskor Q1 net rises to PLN 1.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemiskor preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.65 vs	0.35</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.35 vs	0.31</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.46 vs	0.18</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Chemiskor SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				  4.59 vs	3.43</p>
<p>    costs of sales			   3.78 vs	2.77</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.89 vs	0.12</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.72 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.02 vs	0.04</p>
<p>    investment				 0.06 vs	0.02</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
